msgid "This .wpress file uses a format we cannot read (it may be compressed or encrypted by All-in-One WP Migration). Export it again without encryption."
msgstr "Fáìlì .wpress yìí ń lo ọ̀nà tí a kò lè kà (ó lè jẹ́ pé a ti sún un pọ̀ tàbí kí All-in-One WP Migration ti fi àkóòdì pamọ́ sí i). Tún un jáde lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i láìsí àkóòdì ààbò."

